  Manage agent fleet
  Root 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000801 · generation 42

› 1. Refresh status           Read the current fleet generation and member states.
  2. Suspend fleet            Seal admissions and suspend leaves before the root.
     Resume fleet (disabled)  Recover the root and then its still-open descendants. (disabled: Fleet
                              is not suspended.)
  3. Close fleet              Close only when every member is idle or final. Confirmation required.

